@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service";
}

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9">
        <h1 class="h3 mb-1">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">Last updated: 9 June 2026</p>

        <div class="alert alert-warning small">
            <strong>Template notice:</strong> these terms are a starting point and must be reviewed by a
            qualified lawyer, and the placeholders completed, before launch.
        </div>

        <p>
            These Terms govern your use of PremiumMotors (the "Platform"), operated by
            <strong>[Operator legal name]</strong> ("we", "us"). By creating an account or using the Platform
            you agree to these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">1. What the Platform is</h2>
        <p>
            PremiumMotors is an <strong>introduction service</strong>. Sellers list vehicles and registered
            users make private offers. <strong>We are not a party to, agent for, or guarantor of any sale.</strong>
            The sale itself — inspection, payment, transfer of ownership, and delivery — happens directly
            between buyer and seller, off the Platform. We do not hold, escrow, or process the price of any vehicle.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">2. Accounts</h2>
        <p>
            You must register with accurate information, keep your credentials secure, and be legally able to
            enter contracts. You are responsible for activity on your account.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">3. Listings</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Publishing a listing is <strong>free</strong>, and we take <strong>no commission</strong> when a car sells. The only thing you can pay us for is advertising — paid placement, which moves a listing up the page and is always labelled as paid.</li>
            <li>You are solely responsible for the accuracy and legality of your listing, and you confirm you have the right to sell the vehicle.</li>
            <li>
                <strong>Refunds:</strong> there is nothing to refund on a listing, because listing is free.
                Refund terms for paid advertising will be set out here before advertising can be bought
                on the site.
            </li>
            <li>We may remove any listing that breaches these Terms or applicable law.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">4. Offers</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Offers are private and visible only to the listing's seller. Other buyers never see them.</li>
            <li>A seller chooses which offer to accept, and is under no obligation to accept the highest one or any offer at all.</li>
            <li>You may withdraw an offer at any time before the seller answers it.</li>
            <li>Accepting an offer reserves the vehicle and automatically declines the other pending offers on that listing.</li>
            <li>Offers are good-faith indications of interest to help the parties connect; the binding sale contract, if any, is formed between buyer and seller directly.</li>
            <li>When a seller accepts your offer, you and the seller exchange contact details so you can complete the sale. Declined offers never result in any contact details being shared.</li>
            <li>Messages you send through the site are visible to the other party to that conversation and to our administrators.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">5. No warranty on vehicles</h2>
        <p>
            We do not inspect, verify, or guarantee any vehicle, listing, seller, or buyer. We make no
            representation about a vehicle's condition, history, ownership, roadworthiness, or value, and we do
            not guarantee that any listing will result in a sale. <strong>Buyers must independently inspect and
            verify any vehicle before paying.</strong>
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">6. Prohibited conduct</h2>
        <p>
            You must not use the Platform for fraud, to list vehicles you do not own or may not lawfully sell,
            to post false information, or to violate any law. We may suspend or terminate accounts that breach
            these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
            To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss arising from a transaction
            between users, from reliance on any listing or offer, or from your use of the Platform. The Platform
            is provided "as is". Nothing in these Terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">8. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms; continued use after a change means you accept the updated Terms.</p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">9. Governing law</h2>
        <p>
            These Terms are governed by the laws of <strong>Albania</strong>, and disputes are subject to the
            courts of <strong>[jurisdiction / city]</strong>, without prejudice to mandatory consumer-protection
            rights you may have where you live.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4">Questions? Contact <strong>[contact email]</strong>. See also our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
</div>
